# Static IPv6 ruleset. Host IPv6 is disabled (sysctl + NetworkManager); this
# keeps the host closed and VPN clients from forwarding over IPv6 even if IPv6
# is ever re-enabled, so isolation never depends on a sysctl.
*filter
:INPUT DROP [0:0]
:FORWARD DROP [0:0]
:OUTPUT DROP [0:0]
-A INPUT -i lo -j ACCEPT
-A OUTPUT -o lo -j ACCEPT
COMMIT
